@startuml
title 原因箇所シーケンス図: ready job と pending phase run の衝突

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "利用者" as User
participant "TranslationJobSetupService\ncreateReadyTranslationJob / createInitialTranslationPhaseRun" as Setup
database "JobLifecycleRepository" as Repo
participant "TranslationJobManagementService\n削除可否判定" as Mgmt
participant "TermTranslationPhaseService\nsummary / StartPhase" as Term

group 作成直後
User -> Setup: ジョブ作成
Setup -> Repo: CreateTranslationJob(state=ready)
Repo --> Setup: job(id=1, state=ready)
Setup -> Repo: CreateJobPhaseRun(phase_type=translation,\nstate=pending)
Repo --> Setup: phaseRun(state=pending)
Setup -> Repo: SaveTranslationJobPhaseRuntimeSnapshot(...)
Setup --> User: ready job を返す
note over Setup, Repo
作成直後に
ready job と pending phase run が同時に残る
end note
end

group 削除判定
User -> Mgmt: 削除可否を確認
Mgmt -> Repo: ListJobPhaseRunsByJobID(jobID=1)
Repo --> Mgmt: [translation pending]
Mgmt -> Mgmt: hasRunningEquivalentPhaseRun(...)
note right of Mgmt
pending を running 相当として扱う
internal/service/translation_job_management_service.go:821-830
end note
Mgmt --> User: 削除不可\n状態不整合
note over Repo
repository 側の hasUnsafeDeletePhaseRun も
pending を unsafe として扱う
internal/repository/job_lifecycle_sqlite_repository.go:613-621
end note
end

group 開始判定と開始実行
User -> Term: summary 取得
Term -> Repo: FindJobPhaseRun(jobID=1, phaseType=translation)
Repo --> Term: existing run(state=pending)
Term -> Term: canStart = Ready && !termTranslationPhaseIsActive(run)
note right of Term
pending は active に含まれない
internal/service/term_translation_phase_service.go:336, 1890-1898
end note
Term --> User: Start は有効に見える

User -> Term: StartPhase(jobID=1)
Term -> Term: rejectStartExecutionPlan(job, run)
note right of Term
run が pending でも
active 判定に引っかからない
internal/service/term_translation_phase_service.go:700-710
end note
Term -> Term: ensureExecutionPlanRun(job, run, ...)
note right of Term
既存 run があるため
初期化 flow を通らない
internal/service/term_translation_phase_service.go:653-663
end note
Term -> Term: resumeExecutionPlanRun(mode=start, run=pending)
note right of Term
paused / recoverable_failed 以外は
run をそのまま返す
internal/service/term_translation_phase_service.go:1064-1086
end note
Term --> User: pending のまま処理継続
note over Term, Repo
実行開始時に pending を running へ
遷移させる分岐が存在しない
end note
end

group 修正方針
note over Setup, Term
Job Setup は作成直後の phase run 作成をやめる。
runtime snapshot だけを保存する。
phase run は StartPhase 時に
term_translation / running で作る既存 flow に寄せる。
end note
end

@enduml
